  "summary": "The traditional art of shadow puppetry using intricately carved and painted leather figures to perform epic stories.",
  "description": "Wayang kulit features flat, ornately decorated leather puppets with articulated limbs, cast against a white screen with a backlit source, creating intricate silhouettes. The art form combines visual art, music, drama, and philosophy, performing stories from the Ramayana and Mahabharata epics, serving as both entertainment and moral education.",
